      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S02",
      "file": "S02.mp3",
      "text": "一锅咖喱，让四个人再也没有回家。",
      "sha256": "7dcefa76b614259992ff7d39895974cebcc56942f48566d97ac4f7d8292f890b",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性成熟男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实案件纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N01",
      "target_start": 5,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S03",
      "file": "S03.mp3",
      "text": "7月25日，园部地区的主妇们，在车库里架起大锅。",
      "sha256": "237b38b2c159ed52c077951d2467c56993d953441f255e1b1a625147302a83b2",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性成熟男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实案件纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 10,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S04",
      "file": "S04.mp3",
      "text": "切土豆、搅咖喱、说说笑笑，汗顺着额头一直往下流。",
      "sha256": "81f29409335c67e59d7f0bac2150571f0ff0c85da47f9eae4ada0325dee67d3e",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性成熟男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实案件纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 17,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S05",
      "file": "S05.mp3",
      "text": "中午，孩子、老人、刚下班的邻居，排队来领饭。",
      "sha256": "0ba2ac536c7c2114910dee5f6eedc4a730f74dae4757cce05ebfd2407f043ef1",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性成熟男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实案件纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 24,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S06",
      "file": "S06.mp3",
      "text": "夕阳很好，蝉声很响，没有人察觉任何异常。",
      "sha256": "007b9eeeb01bce93bd0bd412dd86f8b84926b9cfd81ad235fa68a726597adb41",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性成熟男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实案件纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 30,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S07",
      "file": "S07.mp3",
      "text": "没过多久，一位老人放下勺子，捂着额头说，头晕。",
      "sha256": "f76b06bc6cc86be259fdb0ed8f0933da3d791861a84efbdb81a29529e4b4b4a5",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性成熟男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实案件纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 35,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S08",
      "file": "S08.mp3",
      "text": "紧接着，人们一个接一个蹲下，有人大喊：咖喱，停！",
      "sha256": "f0139cfaee824e56e16602ca2694ff816d3012b8e976ef75b9438cd95ad566cf",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性成熟男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实案件纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 42,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S09",
      "file": "S09.mp3",
      "text": "救护车一辆接一辆开进窄街，红灯在墙上打转。",
      "sha256": "74a1cb8ba37b06ced0870055614b768b0b088795b8812bd801c7780345635cf6",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性成熟男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实案件纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 49,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S10",
      "file": "S10.mp3",
      "text": "医生起初以为，这只是夏天的食物中毒。",
      "sha256": "5bccd99953a252d8b414866926af3771d07078a4a2d93b9556818dbc33124dcd",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性成熟男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实案件纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 55,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S11",
      "file": "S11.mp3",
      "text": "可症状越来越重：六十七人中毒，四个人没能救回来。",
      "sha256": "56c63c897210c30a4883bc287179a15a296c8a259f156a1767a0bfebc621f069",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性成熟男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实案件纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 60,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S12",
      "file": "S12.mp3",
      "text": "检验结果出来了：让所有人中毒的，是砒霜，也就是砷。",
      "sha256": "f227e7cb9376e0fc3477ce52bf1677f470c15dcbaa05970dddbd955566daaddb",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性成熟男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实案件纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 67,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S13",
      "file": "S13.mp3",
      "text": "所以这不是食物中毒，这是一次蓄意的投毒。",
      "sha256": "b5c9b8c991e01d365638800e87191e367f5370bbf72a9b24e73413c6a6077207",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性成熟男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实案件纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 74,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S14",
      "file": "S14.mp3",
      "text": "全城震惊。警方在那口锅周围拉起警戒线。",
      "sha256": "cd53b1872b93e25546dbe36845c03edb98185acf474a22dad1872276155140c4",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性成熟男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实案件纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 80,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S15",
      "file": "S15.mp3",
      "text": "警方要查清楚：谁靠近过那口锅？谁有机会一个人留下？",
      "sha256": "62e07245a24af50702479df77d819d97cde92653f233289addbbf5635300c6e9",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性成熟男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实案件纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 85,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S16",
      "file": "S16.mp3",
      "text": "那天进过车库的每一个人，都被重新排查一遍。",
      "sha256": "e6a4092b8ac5f4fb1f8848c5294df41e018278058ca450aa68cc7ef56612363f",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性成熟男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实案件纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 92,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S17",
      "file": "S17.mp3",
      "text": "法院后来认定：有一位主妇，曾独自看管过一段时间。",
      "sha256": "2eb1d7a6e786428fcd11b9a2485169cef9bba2d2ae9ec9753465bf2988784823",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性成熟男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实案件纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 99,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S18",
      "file": "S18.mp3",
      "text": "她叫林真须美，那年37岁，就住在这条街上。",
      "sha256": "55fcfa487c966c4e36790ae983f258d634c8c2c0a31eb4c27fd8be3c6430b083",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性成熟男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实案件纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 105,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S19",
      "file": "S19.mp3",
      "text": "她和丈夫健治，做过保险推销和灭白蚁，都碰过砷。",
      "sha256": "552b3f155b703e9922853a43a09c736822ce2b31ebb04022ecf0088c801fb6cf",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性成熟男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实案件纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 110,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S20",
      "file": "S20.mp3",
      "text": "警方在她家搜出一包白色粉末；检验之后，是同样的砷。",
      "sha256": "fa2ca8a714ab9f4b2d2439a055d099d027c5b2e2410da573f0ff68a6c2c1a4e7",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性成熟男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实案件纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 117,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S21",
      "file": "S21.mp3",
      "text": "案发之前那十年，夫妻俩多次靠保险诈骗拿到钱。",
      "sha256": "07eb4ecbb6fb6c4ddbe5fdd8b5640b6cb2721c89caebfb01ebcf064c62d91246",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性成熟男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实案件纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 124,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S22",
      "file": "S22.mp3",
      "text": "检方说：家里的砷，和锅里的砷，成分相同。",
      "sha256": "149682c69afdc54c5ffe363c435a0f34eb1d2b2d3d7f63ada8d80a0b1754fefd",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性成熟男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实案件纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 130,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S23",
      "file": "S23.mp3",
      "text": "记者围住她家；她举起水管朝镜头喷水，水花溅在镜片上。",
      "sha256": "c826dcfbd14046ae845046db10375f241647555e17c92d62ed709e60f076bc8e",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性成熟男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实案件纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N07",
      "target_start": 135,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S24",
      "file": "S24.mp3",
      "text": "这一幕传遍全国。很多人看完，心里已经先判了她。",
      "sha256": "e33de1b38936c8711494d84f144c5eb3a898cfcd68654f36350c278ae0b2a7c5",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性成熟男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实案件纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N07",
      "target_start": 142,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S25",
      "file": "S25.mp3",
      "text": "同年12月，她因这锅咖喱被捕；她说：我没有做。",
      "sha256": "313d0e329aa2405f26b8b6fc0d9e17cf9647e6b56a3d4c77f6a4c6279b300bf9",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性成熟男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实案件纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N07",
      "target_start": 149,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S26",
      "file": "S26.mp3",
      "text": "2002年，和歌山地方法院，判处她死刑。",
      "sha256": "e91ee1437c02012c1ed04f7404036e6912df1c83da78c425ee347ce8331c448f",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性成熟男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实案件纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N08",
      "target_start": 155,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S27",
      "file": "S27.mp3",
      "text": "没有动机，没有直接证据；法院靠的是鉴定和证词。",
      "sha256": "994607f41e085bcc59edfa8dff1319cac73864283dcbc567026da679081bbc6e",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性成熟男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实案件纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N08",
      "target_start": 161,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S28",
      "file": "S28.mp3",
      "text": "2009年，最高法院维持死刑；辩方质疑证据。",
      "sha256": "38d2a566d650716de74bdff4041d6bd89ed930e2d72e2249f64830135c953bb9",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "沉稳磁性成熟男声；讲故事语气，句尾收得轻，像真实案件纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N08",
      "target_start": 167,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S29",
      "file": "S29.mp3",
      "text": "她至今在狱中喊冤；第三度再审还在审理。你觉得，凶手是她吗？",
      "sha256": "9da52cf4360fede69ab7a9604f1d507b021df1e5e1ea511a42b614230adff6d6",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
